If we DID add them, they would have to go in `spec`, right?  Meaning that they apply to devices and gizmos and so on.  If we only want them to apply to devices, then we sould need to add ANOTHER indirection:


```diff
 	// Devices lists some or all of the devices in this pool.
-	//
